{"video":"YLy-X0QWuWA","lines":[{"t":[0,16],"en":"Last week, I gave a fire safety talk, and nobody paid any attention."},{"t":[17.1,19.1],"en":"It's my own fault for using PowerPoint."},{"t":[19.9,20.9],"en":"PowerPoint is boring."},{"t":[21.9,27.1],"en":"People learn in lots of different ways, but experience is the best teacher."},{"t":[30,35.4],"en":"Today, smoking is going to save lives."},{"t":[54.4,56.4],"en":"Does anyone smell anything smoky?"},{"t":[57,58.8],"en":"Did you bring your jerky in again?"},{"t":[60,62.1],"en":"Eh-eh-eh-eh-eh-hem."},{"t":[64.5,66.3],"en":"Oh, my God! Uh, oh, my God!"},{"t":[67.6,68.1],"en":"Fire!"},{"t":[68.3,70.8],"en":"Oh, fire? Oh, my goodness. What's the procedure?"},{"t":[71.2,72.2],"en":"What do we do, people?"},{"t":[72.3,72.9],"en":"The bones are dead."},{"t":[73.1,74.5],"en":"Oh, how did that happen?"},{"t":[74.5,75.5],"en":"It's out in the hall."},{"t":[75.5,77.9],"en":"No, we don't know that. The smoke could be coming through an air duct."},{"t":[77.9,79.6],"en":"Oh, my God! Okay, it's happening."},{"t":[80,80.8],"en":"Everybody stay calm."},{"t":[80.8,82.7],"en":"What's the procedure, everyone? What's the procedure?"},{"t":[82.8,84],"en":"Stay f***ing calm!"},{"t":[84.1,86.3],"en":"Wait, wait, wait, wait. Everybody just f***ing calm down!"},{"t":[86.5,90.5],"en":"No, no, Michael, no! Touch the handle. If it's hot, there could be a fire in the hallway."},{"t":[92.7,93.6],"en":"What does warm mean?"},{"t":[93.7,94.1],"en":"Oh, my God."},{"t":[94.1,95.9],"en":"Not a viable option."},{"t":[96.3,96.9],"en":"What next?"},{"t":[96.9,97.4],"en":"Don't run!"},{"t":[97.4,97.9],"en":"Go to the other door."},{"t":[98,101],"en":"Oh, here's the door. Check that one out. How's the handle?"},{"t":[101.3,102],"en":"It's warm."},{"t":[102.1,102.5],"en":"Okay, go to the back door."},{"t":[102.5,103.9],"en":"Well, another option."},{"t":[104,104.4],"en":"The back door."},{"t":[104.5,104.8],"en":"Option."},{"t":[105.1,107.1],"en":"Oh, jeez, okay. Settle down, everyone. No bunches."},{"t":[107.1,107.9],"en":"I forgot my purse."},{"t":[108,108.9],"en":"Leave it, woman!"},{"t":[109.1,110.1],"en":"Get out of the way. Go, go, go!"},{"t":[110.1,111.7],"en":"No, things can be replaced, Phyllis."},{"t":[111.9,114.6],"en":"People, human lives, however, can..."},{"t":[114.6,118.9],"en":"Ah, my hand! That's hot!"},{"t":[119.2,120.6],"en":"Ah, this one's hot, too!"},{"t":[120.8,122.7],"en":"Okay, we're trapped, everyone, for himself!"},{"t":[122.9,123.7],"en":"Okay, let's go!"},{"t":[123.8,124.5],"en":"Let's go!"},{"t":[124.6,125.2],"en":"Get out of my way!"},{"t":[125.4,126.3],"en":"Okay, okay."},{"t":[126.9,127.4],"en":"Call."},{"t":[127.4,128.7],"en":"Get out of the way!"},{"t":[128.9,130.2],"en":"Have you ever seen a burn victim?"},{"t":[130.8,133.6],"en":"Okay, procedure, procedure."},{"t":[134.4,135.5],"en":"Exit options!"},{"t":[135.8,136.9],"en":"Where do we go, folks?"},{"t":[137.1,138.7],"en":"Use a what to cover the mouth?"},{"t":[138.8,139.2],"en":"A what?"},{"t":[139.5,140.5],"en":"A rag!"},{"t":[140.6,141.7],"en":"A damp rag, perhaps."},{"t":[142.6,144.2],"en":"Let's remember those procedures."},{"t":[144.5,145.2],"en":"What are the options?"},{"t":[146.1,147.1],"en":"That's the wrong way."},{"t":[147.2,148.3],"en":"We've already tried that."},{"t":[148.7,150.2],"en":"Remember your exit points."},{"t":[150.3,151.5],"en":"Exit points, people."},{"t":[151.6,152],"en":"What's next?"},{"t":[152,152.4],"en":"Oscar!"},{"t":[152.5,153.6],"en":"Stay alive!"},{"t":[153.6,154.3],"en":"I'm getting help!"},{"t":[154.4,155.1],"en":"Pull me out!"},{"t":[155.2,155.8],"en":"You're too heavy!"},{"t":[156,157.4],"en":"I only weigh 82 pounds!"},{"t":[158.4,159.6],"en":"Safe bandit!"},{"t":[162.9,164],"en":"How about 911?"},{"t":[164,164.9],"en":"Any one?"},{"t":[164.9,165.3],"en":"911?"},{"t":[165.3,165.4],"en":"911?"},{"t":[176.3,177.2],"en":"What do we do?"},{"t":[177.5,180.9],"en":"Use the surge of fear and adrenaline to sharpen your decision-making."},{"t":[181.1,182.2],"en":"Okay, I am not dying here."},{"t":[182.3,182.5],"en":"Come on."},{"t":[186.7,187.6],"en":"What is that?"},{"t":[187.7,188.4],"en":"What is that?"},{"t":[188.4,190.4],"en":"The fire's shooting at us!"},{"t":[190.4,193.4],"en":"What in the name of God is going on?"},{"t":[207.4,208.4],"en":"Held!"},{"t":[209.4,210.4],"en":"Held!"},{"t":[216.4,218.4],"en":"Attention!"},{"t":[218.4,220.4],"en":"Employees of Dunder Mifflin!"},{"t":[220.4,223.4],"en":"This has been a test of our emergency preparedness."},{"t":[223.4,224.4],"en":"There is no fire."},{"t":[224.4,226.4],"en":"It was only a simulation."},{"t":[226.4,227.4],"en":"What?"},{"t":[227.4,228.4],"en":"Fire."},{"t":[228.4,229.4],"en":"Not real."},{"t":[229.4,231.4],"en":"This was merely a training exercise."},{"t":[232.4,234.4],"en":"So, what have we learned?"},{"t":[235.4,236.4],"en":"Oh, come on."},{"t":[236.4,237.4],"en":"It's not real, Stanley."},{"t":[237.4,238.4],"en":"Don't have a heart attack."},{"t":[238.4,239.4],"en":"No, no, no, no, no!"},{"t":[239.4,240.4],"en":"You will not die!"},{"t":[240.4,241.4],"en":"Stanley!"},{"t":[241.4,242.4],"en":"Stanley, you will not die!"},{"t":[242.4,243.4],"en":"Stanley!"},{"t":[243.4,244.4],"en":"Stanley!"},{"t":[244.4,245.4],"en":"Barack is president!"},{"t":[245.4,246.4],"en":"You are black, Stanley!"},{"t":[246.4,247.4],"en":"I'm going to give him mouth-to-mouth."},{"t":[247.4,248.4],"en":"No, no, no."},{"t":[248.4,249.4],"en":"Don't give him mouth-to-mouth for this."},{"t":[249.4,250.4],"en":"You're going to swallow his tongue."},{"t":[250.4,251.4],"en":"Open your mouth!"},{"t":[251.4,252.4],"en":"Michael!"},{"t":[252.4,253.4],"en":"Don't swallow it!"},{"t":[253.4,254.4],"en":"I'm fine!"},{"t":[254.4,255.4],"en":"Leave me alone!"},{"t":[255.4,257.4],"en":"I'm saving him!"},{"t":[258.4,259.4],"en":"I'm saving him!"}]}
